{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_028ari01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_028ari01_title", "source_sha256": "f90b65213e619a175d8d2700b560fc755b3eddb116f79e4eb5c8123994363a7a", "ja": "亜利沙とおでかけ1", "zh": "和亚利沙外出1", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_028ari01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_028ari01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "0d49a06a1b027051d4dfa227361d64dcae4d2631dabb96e761dbe322427c7e6b", "ja": "亜利沙とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "记录了和亚利沙出门时的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_028ari01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_028ari01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "e2617f867532f35fa923735b6dd4f7ea483e6925d1cf80bf5f5d283f9f4482aa", "ja": "（富山のラジオから、亜利沙に出演オファーがあった！\nなんでも、ご当地アイドルとの共演だそうだが……）", "zh": "（富山的广播电台向亚利沙发来了出演邀请！听说是要和当地偶像同台演出……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_028ari01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_028ari01_1001_028ari", "source_sha256": "7adf5566b5fa520d0cf4199dc8b19e2437acbf019a262fca186f2016f534fe68", "ja": "ムフフ……ムフーッ！　普段はなかなか会えない、\nご当地アイドルちゃんと共演できるなんて……♪", "zh": "嘿嘿……嘿——！居然能和通常很难见到的当地偶像们一起演出……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_028ari01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_028ari01_1002_p", "source_sha256": "8949cb9c2e6d67fa95c9761c2194d9df7ad025aaa65fff9ac642a4abdd043735", "ja": "富山のご当地アイドル『薬売りシスターズ』さんか。\nなるほど、ナース服をコスチュームにしているんだな。", "zh": "富山的当地偶像“卖药修女”啊。\n原来如此，是以护士服当作演出服的啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_028ari01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_028ari01_1003_028ari", "source_sha256": "c565dd3d5a1d8ed895b5765359d0e5ef8ebeb50ba2aac12bda9eae2b44a90b28", "ja": "かわっ！　かわいいっ！　写真は撮らせてもらえるんで\nしょうか！？　あ、でも仕事中に迷惑ですよね……。", "zh": "好可爱！太可爱了！可以让我拍张照片吗！？啊，不过你们正在工作，这样会打扰到你们吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_028ari01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_028ari01_1004_p", "source_sha256": "4fc26318d9ee5dc764aa0b3000558f0219ad5b4601dce2543512949ae93459be", "ja": "終わった後なら大丈夫じゃないか？　本番を\nしっかりやれば、拒否される事もないだろうし。", "zh": "结束后应该就没问题了吧？只要好好完成正式演出，应该不会被拒绝吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_028ari01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_028ari01_1005_028ari", "source_sha256": "bd355eb4eb22a5a14c6aed3e99b781cbc2e5249bde00a995860c8afb5158efca", "ja": "そ、そうですよね！　ありさ、がんばりますっ！", "zh": "对、对吧！亚利沙会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_028ari01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_028ari01_1006_p", "source_sha256": "b5b2a4bfa9b4eff371dbe7a315242182ad7c0879b99656db82c65448053be47d", "ja": "（こうして亜利沙はしっかりと仕事をこなし、\n念願のツーショット写真を手に入れた……）", "zh": "（就这样，亚利沙认真完成了工作，拿到了梦寐以求的双人合照……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_028ari01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_028ari01_1007_028ari", "source_sha256": "868a8a6acd89a78fae9d0da10c9d3d40745e3c2028704237acf67f357baa0a14", "ja": "ふぉーーっ！！　見てください、コレ！　激レアです！\nしかも、ありさの名前まで入れてくれてっ……！", "zh": "哇——！！请看这个！超级稀有！\n而且还特意写上了亚利沙的名字……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_028ari01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_028ari01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "683a24a580c866e1d28248c1bb42c4cfa7902f825e825e3ea3e8b746c9c11d2c", "ja": "よかったな！　それに、先方も亜利沙の写真を\n欲しがってたみたいだし……交換できてよかったな！", "zh": "太好了！而且对方好像也\n很想要亚利沙的照片……能交换真是太好了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_028ari01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_028ari01_1009_028ari", "source_sha256": "cd005b56bbb197cdcb2261a1665d927fd3b62f57aecd4a9ce52265c2db66add2", "ja": "そ、それはまあ、びっくりしましたけど……ありさも\nアイドルちゃんですからね！　光栄に思います！", "zh": "那、那个确实让我吓了一跳，不过……阿利沙也是偶像嘛！我感到非常荣幸！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_028ari01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_028ari01_1010_028ari", "source_sha256": "d286f88a1fea140cb62c237d9285c55ee3b082f64c63a97104475566d9d3c61c", "ja": "目指せ、全国のご当地アイドルちゃん写真、\nコンプリート！　夢が広がりますよぉ～っ！", "zh": "目标是收集齐全国各地的本土偶像照片！这样一来，梦想就更加广阔了哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0235_story_028ari01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0235_story_028ari01_1011_p", "source_sha256": "8b6e41fc15cca300ee573191f268ad3bdba49dfa377e46ba99cb288c79659369", "ja": "（なかなか壮大な夢が出来たようだな。この調子で日本\n全国を回っていれば、いつか……。頑張れ、亜利沙！）", "zh": "（看来她似乎有了个相当宏大的梦想。照这样走遍日本全国的话，总有一天……加油，亚利沙！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
